{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5c06106d4f96a4f8275aa5924c32bd057e605bfd73f4600e49e24a81481141cc", "ja": "杏奈、お疲れさま。大丈夫か？\nアクションシーンが多いから、体力使ったよな。", "zh": "杏奈，辛苦了。还好吗？\n动作戏很多，消耗了不少体力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "e4258d9436d4b9b1af50e1c67da88f1241351656f3310c643702c1a396626152", "ja": "ん……。ちょっと……。\nでも、大丈夫……少し休んだら、いけます……。", "zh": "嗯……有点……\n不过，没事的……稍微休息一下，就还能继续……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "4fda48b4f3e020914860213d765e4b46f8d72f34f6d59747218c0c1d6b7ac045", "ja": "杏奈……最後のシーン、\n楽しみにしてたから……頑張れる、よ……。", "zh": "因为一直很期待……最后的场景，\n所以还能坚持……的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1005_p", "source_sha256": "41df335f455550fd4b522f9a21eaa89cc0520129ad52bc285c0e828206e84e83", "ja": "摩天楼を駆け抜けていくシーンだよな。\nまあ無理しないで、ゆっくり休んでから挑もう。", "zh": "是冲过摩天大楼的场景吧。  \n不过别勉强自己，休息好了再挑战吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "26bfb42d6357c17643eb9556a23b7896e89be8e8de948125c0949a4a0476ae2f", "ja": "ん……さっき、スタッフさんが……動画、\n見せてくれて……CGの町……。", "zh": "嗯……刚才，工作人员给杏奈看了……视频，CG城镇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "4120a5bf341655305cab70d8a5b785dc80b67ec083014b568d567b4a00be23d2", "ja": "すごく、綺麗で……。杏奈も、\nあの中に入れると思うと……楽しみ、です……♪", "zh": "特别漂亮……一想到杏奈也能进入那里……就很期待……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e5050211e187e153069dbff519854d7597011428d26341e14baffc4509938fe7", "ja": "うん。最新技術がたくさん使われてるそうだ。\n杏奈にとっては、ゲームと似たような感覚なのかな？", "zh": "嗯。听说里面采用了很多最新技术。\n对杏奈来说，感觉可能和游戏差不多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "22a9f657599641fd9cf653a0a64770789728c61ede6f63e7e5ad2d716a389eb6", "ja": "ん、そうかも……？\n世界観とか、設定とか……気になり、ます……。", "zh": "嗯，也许是吧……？\n世界观啦，设定之类的……还挺在、意的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "f583ee42dfce359cdfaf7638d3d65c3758afd432b723781a8e561f663cfa338e", "ja": "どんな食べ物があるのかな、とか……。\n他の場所とか、どうなってるのかな、とか……。", "zh": "不知道会有些什么食物呢……还有其他地方会是什么样子呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "903eab974bd90c5c652dea657816c5787ede57933f7615a7217e1c080b7b65c4", "ja": "完成した映画、観たら……。\nそういう設定とかも、わかるかな……？", "zh": "要是看了制作完成的电影……\n是不是也能弄明白那些设定呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d8dafadfb566bc2bcf59497d1e55da3555660cd2a3accad56ebecc01f4fbc3be", "ja": "ああ、そうなるんじゃないか？\n見どころたくさんの映画になりそうだ。", "zh": "啊，应该会变成那样吧？\n看来会是一部看点十足的电影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8024ff793005c41513bf730e9d2f819ae5f66a6e4d1c1ac4c1b2460775c2fd90", "ja": "後はクライマックス、もうひと頑張りだな！\n……疲れ、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "接下来就是高潮部分了，再加把劲吧！\n……累不累，还吃得消吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "9b76da388ba794b64d375592f19d9959f3ce5a848c327ffba7406e42e28e4ec3", "ja": "ん……そういえば……？\nもう全然、大丈夫そう、です……。", "zh": "嗯……经你这么一说……？\n好像已经完全、没问题了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "3371da2eedb5ab26f33e54ca62ed7e276d8ad1f60d95f783a95048810942bb3c", "ja": "楽しく、話せたから……元気、出てきたのかな？\n{$P$}さんの、おかげ、だね……♪", "zh": "因为聊得很开心……所以，感觉恢复精神了吧？\n多亏了{$P$}先生呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3a09e4071c057fa9784d7ab103fe211a72e865ab77680e2d868fc8d4aaf5c007", "ja": "いや、何もしてないよ。むしろこっちこそ、\nワクワクしてきた！　ありがとうな。", "zh": "不，我什么都没做。倒不如说是我自己，\n也变得兴奋起来了！谢谢你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "48bbda8e4e599511a7d5c66927a0e14a90335b1594874c60417937d54e21c6e7", "ja": "うん……。今、すごく楽しい……です♪\n最後のシーンも……はやく、撮りたい……。", "zh": "嗯……。我现在、觉得特别开心……♪\n最后的场景……也想快点、拍好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "ed3efbd6c809a9ce9054d203e9d55738bf001b176568e27d7dd12da3e0ae5c38", "ja": "……。いい風。\nこの風に乗って、どこまでも行けそう……。", "zh": "……。好舒服的风。\n乘着这阵风，感觉能飞去任何地方……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0274_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "4a85bb2e89f64d597c76ecc895df8071de785f7f93ab0898e7fd7520391a0a87", "ja": "月夜のうさぎの、配達員……。\nワクワクをお届けしちゃうから……見てて、ね♪", "zh": "月夜兔子的，快递员……。\n要把满满的期待送到你手中……看好了，哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
